# Credentials — never commit. The push adapters read APNs `.p8` and FCM
# service-account JSON via the CLI's `tenants set-push` command, which
# wraps the file with AES-256-GCM and stores the ciphertext in SQLite.
# The plaintext files should stay on the operator's workstation only.
*.p8
*.pem
*-service-account.json
service-account*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Scope: commit the event log (.scope/events/), never the SQLite cache.
.scope/scope.db
.scope/scope.db-wal
.scope/scope.db-shm

# Optional detached schema signature (FR-45). Emitted only when
# FRICK_SCHEMA_SIGNING_KEY is set during `pnpm schema:generate`; published as a
# release-pipeline artifact, never committed to the repo.
packages/protocol/generated/
